# Lightweight Validation Scenario

**Status:** Supporting — fast smoke tests, not the paper baseline.

## Purpose

Minimal vehicle count for quick MAC/application checks without full highway density matrix.

## Configs

`plain`, `edca_only`, `edca_v2x_vo_stable` (no netload matrix, no emergency/guarded variants).

## Run

```bash
cd veins/bin && ./veins_launchd -vv
cd veins_qos/simulations/veins_inet_light
./run -u Cmdenv -c edca_v2x_vo_stable
```

